# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in. Neither is required: with both
# unset the game simply shows no "report a mistake" link.
#
# Everything here is compiled into the JavaScript the browser downloads. These
# are not secrets and cannot be — treat every value as public the moment the
# site is deployed. Never put an API key or a token in this file.

# Preferred: a report form. Exposes a form, not a person.
# `{subject}` is replaced by the reported question id.
# VITE_REPORT_URL=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/FORM_ID/viewform?usp=pp_url&entry.123456={subject}

# Fallback: a WhatsApp number, international form, no + and no spaces.
# This publishes a personal phone number to every visitor. Prefer the form.
# VITE_REPORT_WHATSAPP=218900000000
